{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29628","headline":"十字水期韦潘侍御同年不至时韦寓居水次故郭汾宁宅 · 李商隐","name":"十字水期韦潘侍御同年不至时韦寓居水次故郭汾宁宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伊水溅溅相背流，朱栏画阁几人游。\n漆灯夜照真无数，蜡炬晨炊竟未休。\n顾我有怀同大梦，期君不至更沉忧。\n西园碧树今谁主，与近高窗卧听秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}